      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kizuna_history_a_04",
      "hash64": "363F0EB6BA159FCF",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Tell me, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]—given a\\nchoice,\\r\\nwhich\\r\\ndo\\r\\nyou\\r\\nprefer?\\c\\nThings of old? Or things that are new?[VAR 0x0114(0027)]",
